# Dependencies and build output are recreated inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local configuration and secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem

# Not needed to build
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.md
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose.ymlexamples
